---
import { NAV_LINKS, SITE, withBase } from '~/consts';

const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="mt-24 border-t border-line bg-paper-deep/60">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 py-14 sm:px-8">
    <div class="grid gap-10 md:grid-cols-[1.6fr_1fr_1fr]">
      <div>
        <p class="font-serif text-lg font-bold text-ink">{SITE.name}</p>
        <p class="mt-1 text-2xs tracking-[0.18em] text-ink-faint uppercase">{SITE.nameEn}</p>
        <p class="mt-4 max-w-sm text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">{SITE.description}</p>
      </div>

      <nav aria-label="頁尾導覽">
        <p class="text-2xs font-medium tracking-[0.18em] text-ink-faint uppercase">網站導覽</p>
        <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2.5">
          {
            NAV_LINKS.map((link) => (
              <li>
                <a
                  href={withBase(link.href)}
                  class="text-sm text-ink-soft transition-colors hover:text-brand"
                >
                  {link.label}
                </a>
              </li>
            ))
          }
          <li>
            <a href={withBase('/rss.xml')} class="text-sm text-ink-soft transition-colors hover:text-brand"
              >RSS 訂閱</a
            >
          </li>
        </ul>
      </nav>

      <div>
        <p class="text-2xs font-medium tracking-[0.18em] text-ink-faint uppercase">編輯原則</p>
        <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2.5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
          <li>官方資料優先，二手資料標明出處</li>
          <li>價格與時刻標註查證日期</li>
          <li>不寫沒查證過的推薦</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div
      class="mt-12 flex flex-col gap-3 border-t border-line pt-6 text-xs text-ink-faint sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between"
    >
      <p>© {year} {SITE.name}. 內容僅供行前參考，出發前請以官方公告為準。</p>
      <p>本站與文中提及的任何飯店、樂園或品牌均無合作或從屬關係。</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
